Build your vocabulary with Picture Flashcards: Word Games! Learn Spanish, French, German, Italian, and 10 more languages with a visual dictionary and vocabulary builder. Nearly 1,700 illustrated flashcards with audio pronunciation, 2–3 minute lessons, and spaced repetition help you remember words long-term. See a drawing, hear the pronunciation, and grasp the meaning without rote cramming—even abstract concepts like "freedom", "dream", and "boredom" are drawn.

HOW A LESSON & VOCABULARY QUIZ WORKS

10 steps per lesson: up to three unfamiliar words and review. Each picture flashcard shows a drawing, translation, and audio, followed by five word quiz tasks:

• Find the Picture — match the word to its drawing;

• Guess by Picture — pick the word for the illustration;

• Listen and Choose — audio quiz to recognize the picture by ear;

• Listen and Find the Word — listening test to pick the spoken word;

• Word Builder — spelling puzzle to assemble the word from letters.

Choices come from one category: next to "grandmother" are "grandfather" and "mother", not a key. You cannot just guess—you must recall. Mistakes return at the end of the lesson in another task. Skip known words after a quick knowledge test.

SPACED REPETITION & COLORING PICTURE DICTIONARY

Words repeat via the Leitner flashcard system after 1, 3, 7, and 21 days, then 2 and 4 months. Tasks get harder: first guess by picture, then listen and spell from letters, and for familiar words face extra vowels or similar letters like é and e.

Learn a word, and its drawing colors in your album! When review time comes, the picture fades—review the card to make it bright again. Each card in your visual dictionary has normal and slow audio, days until review, and the same word in other languages with audio.

4 WORD GAMES FOR SPELLING & MEMORY PRACTICE

Games use only studied words and unlock as your vocabulary grows:

• Pairs — memory match with 12 cards: pair the drawing and its word;

• Assemble the Word — spell 8 words by picture using a letter hint;

• Dictation — audio test: hear 10 words and build them from letters;

• Blitz — 60-second true-or-false trivia: swipe right or left! Get 5 in a row for x2 points, 10 for x3. Beat your high score!

45 VOCABULARY TOPICS & 14 LANGUAGES

Pick any topic for lessons ordered from basic to advanced words: animals, birds, insects, sea life, people & family, professions, human body, health & medicine, food, fruits & berries, vegetables & herbs, drinks, kitchen & tableware, home & furniture, household, hygiene & beauty, clothes & shoes, accessories & jewelry, tools, transport & road, city & buildings, farm & garden, nature, plants, weather, space, time, sports, games & toys, music, art, holidays, school & stationery, science, tech & electronics, money, law, history & war, fairy tales & magic, shapes & signs, materials, actions & sounds, feelings & concepts.

Learn English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Dutch, Polish, Czech, Serbian (Latin), Ukrainian, Greek, Turkish, and Russian. Pick any as your native language and study one or several at once with separate progress and albums. German, French, Spanish, and Italian words include articles: die Katze, le chat, el gato.

STARS, DAILY STREAK & WHO IT SUITS

Earn stars in lessons and word games. Hit your daily goal of 1, 2, or 4 lessons (about 2, 5, or 10 minutes) for +5 stars, and keep a 7-day streak for +10 stars.

• For beginners: learn languages from scratch—start with three words in two minutes;

• For vocabulary builders: learn English words or expand your foreign lexicon;

• For travelers: study food, transport, city, and health words before a trip.

AVEM est l'application mobile de la console Avemplace (ORYX.SIC) pour les opérateurs et administrateurs de réseaux de bornes de recharge.

Avec AVEM vous pouvez :
• vous connecter avec votre compte Avemplace ;
• suivre l'état des bornes et des sites en temps réel ;
• consulter sessions, alertes et reporting ;
• piloter les actions OCPP (démarrage / arrêt distant, reset, déverrouillage) selon vos droits.

AVEM affiche la console web sécurisée dans une application native. Un compte validé est obligatoire — l'app n'est pas destinée aux conducteurs grand public.

Support : ORYX.SIC / Avemplace — https://avemplace.com
Politique de confidentialité : https://avemplace.com/privacy.html

Consignerie Traiteurs est l'application des traiteurs partenaires de La Consignerie.

Elle réunit au même endroit :
- les commandes reçues et leurs modifications, à accepter en un geste ;
- le calendrier des livraisons et vos périodes d'indisponibilité ;
- les livraisons et l'assignation des livreurs ;
- les messages avec l'équipe La Consignerie ;
- le dépôt des factures.

Les notifications vous préviennent d'une nouvelle commande, d'un changement de dernière minute ou d'un message de l'équipe.

L'application est réservée aux traiteurs partenaires de La Consignerie : l'accès se fait avec le compte fourni par La Consignerie.
